DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ssiirrttooppnnmm  reads a Solitaire Image Recorder file as input and produces a
       PNM image as output.  The type of the output file depends on the  input
       file  - if it's an MGI TYPE 17 file, ssiirrttooppnnmm generates a PGM file.  If
       it's an MGI TYPE 11 file, ssiirrttooppnnmm generates PPM.   The  program  tells
       you which type it is writing.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
